### MIT License (MIT) — 0b306e2f2cb6

cargo-about matched no licence file to this licence for the crates listed below with their authors, so it wrote its SPDX template for them; the template names no copyright holder. The authors beside each crate are the ones its manifest lists. The licence files that these crates ship, where they ship any, and the texts that the policy commits for them are written under Notice and licence files from the crate sources.

